	(text "Generated from docs/ac30_schematica.jpg (SWTPC AC-30 Cassette Tape Switching Schematic),\ndocs/AC30-BOM.md and docs/ac30_wiring1a.jpg. Connectivity is by net label: identical labels are connected.\nTranscription notes / assumptions:\n - Drawing pin-number slips corrected to the real pinouts: IC7D drawn 8->9 (4049: 9->10);\n   IC13C drawn inputs 7,8 (4070: 8,9).\n - 4053 INH (pin 6) and VEE (pin 7) are not shown on the drawing; tied to GND.\n - IC10 pins 4/8 tie to the R38 supply node, assumed +5V.\n - IC15 (1488) supply pins are not shown; brought out as V_RS232+ / V_RS232- (source on power sheet, unknown).\n - CONTROL INVERT: drawn as R42 pull-up; it is also brought out on J4.\n - J1-J5 pin positions match the original artwork (docs/ac30_redblue150.jpg); J1 pin 15 is\n   unlabelled there and left unused.\n - MIC/EAR jack reference designators J6-J9 are assigned arbitrarily; J10/J11 are the motor jacks.\n - BOM switch S6 does not appear on the switching schematic (placed unwired on sheet 2)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "96bcb7f9-9941-5bad-9539-d3337ffa359d")
	)
	(text "RS-232 receivers / drivers, clock clamps"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
